"Compute the displacement patterns needed to determine the FCs (retrieve them "
"with :meth:`get_displacement_patterns`)."
msgstr "力定数の決定に必要な変位パターンを計算します (:meth:`get_displacement_patterns` で取得できます)。"

#: alm.alm.ALM.optimize:1 of
msgid "Fit the force constants to the training data."
msgstr "訓練データに力定数をフィットします。"

