msgid "solver"
msgstr "solver"

#: alm.alm.ALM.optimize:-1 alm.alm.ALM.save_fc:-1 of
msgid "str"
msgstr "str"

#: alm.alm.ALM.optimize:6 of
msgid ""
"'dense' (LAPACK) or one of the sparse solvers (case-insensitive): "
"SimplicialLDLT, SparseQR, ConjugateGradient, LeastSquaresConjugateGradient, "
"BiCGSTAB, SuiteSparseQR, CHOLMOD."
msgstr ""
"'dense' (LAPACK) または疎ソルバーのいずれか (大文字小文字は区別しません): SimplicialLDLT, SparseQR, "
"ConjugateGradient, LeastSquaresConjugateGradient, BiCGSTAB, SuiteSparseQR, "
"CHOLMOD。"

#: alm.alm.ALM.get_fc:15 alm.alm.ALM.optimize:11 of
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: alm.alm.ALM.optimize:13 of
msgid "Solver info code (0 on success)."
msgstr "ソルバーのinfoコード (成功時は 0) です。"

#: alm.alm.ALM.optimize:17 of
msgid ""
"With ``optimizer_control['cross_validation']`` set, this runs cross-"
"validation instead of a single fit; the optimal alpha is then available as "
":attr:`cv_l1_alpha`."
msgstr ""
"``optimizer_control['cross_validation']`` "
"が設定されている場合、単一のフィットの代わりにクロスバリデーションを実行します。得られた最適なアルファ値は :attr:`cv_l1_alpha` "
"から取得できます。"

#: alm.alm.ALM.get_matrix_elements:1 of
msgid "Return the sensing matrix and force vector (A, b) for external solvers."
msgstr "外部ソルバー向けにセンシング行列と力ベクトル (A, b) を返します。"

#: alm.alm.ALM.get_matrix_elements:3 of
msgid ""
"A has shape (nrows, n_free_parameters) in Fortran order, b shape (nrows,); "
"the fitted parameters solve ``A @ x = b`` and can be injected back with "
":meth:`set_fc`."
msgstr ""
"A はFortran順の shape (nrows, n_free_parameters)、b は shape (nrows,) "
"です。フィットしたパラメータは ``A @ x = b`` の解であり、:meth:`set_fc` で書き戻せます。"

#: alm.alm.ALM.get_fc:1 of
msgid "Return force constants as ``(values, elem_indices)``."
msgstr "力定数を ``(values, elem_indices)`` として返します。"

#: alm.alm.ALM.get_fc:5 of
msgid "fc_order"
msgstr "fc_order"

#: alm.alm.ALM.get_fc:6 of
msgid "1 = harmonic (FC2), 2 = cubic (FC3), ..."
msgstr "1 = 調和 (FC2)、2 = 3次 (FC3)、... です。"

#: alm.alm.ALM.get_fc:7 of
msgid "mode"
msgstr "mode"

#: alm.alm.ALM.get_fc:-1 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{'origin', 'irreducible', 'all'}"
msgstr "{'origin', 'irreducible', 'all'}"

#: alm.alm.ALM.get_fc:8 of
msgid ""
"'origin': FCs whose first atom sits in the primitive cell at the origin; "
"'irreducible': the symmetry-irreducible set; 'all': FCs expanded over every "
"pure translation."
msgstr ""
"'origin': 最初の原子が原点の基本セルにある力定数、'irreducible': 対称既約なセット、'all': "
"すべての純並進に展開した力定数です。"

#: alm.alm.ALM.get_fc:11 of
msgid "permutation"
msgstr "permutation"

#: alm.alm.ALM.get_fc:-1 of
msgid "bool"
msgstr "bool"

#: alm.alm.ALM.get_fc:12 of
msgid "Include index-permuted copies of each element."
msgstr "各要素のインデックス置換コピーを含めるかどうかです。"

#: alm.alm.ALM.get_fc:16 of
msgid "values"
msgstr "values"

#: alm.alm.ALM.get_fc:-1 of
msgid "ndarray, shape (n,)"
msgstr "ndarray, shape (n,)"

#: alm.alm.ALM.get_fc:17 of
msgid "Force constants in Ry/Bohr^(fc_order+1)."
msgstr "力定数 (単位は Ry/Bohr^(fc_order+1)) です。"

#: alm.alm.ALM.get_fc:18 of
msgid "elem_indices"
msgstr "elem_indices"

#: alm.alm.ALM.get_fc:-1 of
msgid "ndarray, shape (n, fc_order+1)"
msgstr "ndarray, shape (n, fc_order+1)"

#: alm.alm.ALM.get_fc:19 of
msgid "Flattened indices 3*atom + xyz of each element."
msgstr "各要素の平坦化インデックス 3*atom + xyz です。"

#: alm.alm.ALM.get_fc:23 of
msgid ""
"The element ordering is not guaranteed to be stable across calls (it differs "
"e.g. between optimize() and set_fc()); always pair ``values`` with "
"``elem_indices`` instead of relying on position."
msgstr ""
"要素の並び順は呼び出し間で安定とは限りません (例えば optimize() と set_fc() では異なります)。位置に依存せず、必ず "
"``values`` を ``elem_indices`` と組にして扱ってください。"

#: alm.alm.ALM.set_fc:1 of
msgid ""
"Inject a free-parameter FC vector (e.g. from an external regressor fit to the"
" matrix returned by :meth:`get_matrix_elements`)."
msgstr ""
"自由パラメータの力定数ベクトルを注入します (例: :meth:`get_matrix_elements` "
"が返す行列に外部回帰モデルをフィットした結果)。"

#: alm.alm.ALM.get_number_of_free_parameters:1 of
msgid ""
"Number of free FC parameters after symmetry and constraint reduction; equals "
"the column count of the matrix returned by :meth:`get_matrix_elements`."
msgstr ""
"対称性と拘束条件による削減後の自由な力定数パラメータの数です。:meth:`get_matrix_elements` が返す行列の列数に等しくなります。"

#: alm.alm.ALM.get_number_of_irred_fc_elements:1 of
msgid ""
"Number of symmetry-irreducible FC elements of the given ``fc_order`` (1 = "
"harmonic)."
msgstr "指定した ``fc_order`` (1 = 調和) の対称既約な力定数要素の数です。"

#: alm.alm.ALM.getmap_primitive_to_supercell:1 of
msgid ""
"Return map_p2s, shape (num_trans, num_atoms_primitive) (legacy orientation)."
msgstr "map_p2s を返します。形状は (num_trans, num_atoms_primitive) (従来の向き)。"

#: alm.alm.ALM.get_displacement_patterns:1 of
msgid ""
"Return a list (per pattern) of ``(atom_index, direction(3,), basis)`` tuples;"
" requires :meth:`suggest` to have run."
msgstr ""
"パターンごとに ``(atom_index, direction(3,), basis)`` のタプルのリストを返します。事前に "
":meth:`suggest` を実行しておく必要があります。"

#: alm.alm.ALM.save_fc:1 of
msgid "Write the force constants to a file."
msgstr "力定数をファイルに書き出します。"

#: alm.alm.ALM.save_fc:5 of
msgid "filename"
msgstr "filename"

#: alm.alm.ALM.save_fc:6 of
msgid "Output path."
msgstr "出力先のパスです。"

#: alm.alm.ALM.save_fc:7 of
msgid "format"
msgstr "format"

#: alm.alm.ALM.save_fc:8 of
msgid ""
"'alamode' (.xml), 'alamode_h5' (.h5, what anphon reads), 'shengbte', "
"'shengbte4', 'qefc', or 'hessian'."
msgstr ""
"'alamode' (.xml)、'alamode_h5' (anphonが読み込む "
".h5)、'shengbte'、'shengbte4'、'qefc'、'hessian' のいずれかです。"

#: alm.alm.ALM.save_fc:10 of
msgid "maxorder_to_save"
msgstr "maxorder_to_save"

#: alm.alm.ALM.save_fc:-1 of
msgid "int, optional"
msgstr "int, optional"

#: alm.alm.ALM.save_fc:11 of
msgid "Highest fc_order to write (default: all defined orders)."
msgstr "書き出す最高のfc_order (デフォルト: 定義したすべての次数) です。"

#: ../../source/alm_python.rst:462
msgid ""
"The ``optimizer_control`` property is a ``dict`` mirroring ALM's "
"``&optimize`` tags; the keys most relevant for comparison with the external "
"regressors are ``linear_model`` (1 = ordinary least squares, 2 = elastic-net,"
" 3 = adaptive LASSO), ``cross_validation``, ``l1_alpha``, and ``l1_ratio``."
msgstr ""
"``optimizer_control`` プロパティは、ALM の ``&optimize`` タグに対応する ``dict`` "
"です。外部回帰器との比較に最も関連するキーは、``linear_model`` (1 = 通常最小二乗法、2 = elastic-net、3 = "
"adaptive LASSO)、``cross_validation``、``l1_alpha``、``l1_ratio`` です。"

#: ../../source/alm_python.rst:469
msgid "See also"
msgstr "関連項目"

#: ../../source/alm_python.rst:471
msgid ":doc:`alm_root` — the ALM command-line program and its input tags."
msgstr ":doc:`alm_root` — ALM コマンドラインプログラムとその入力タグ。"

#: ../../source/alm_python.rst:472
msgid ""
"The ``optimizer_control`` property exposes ALM's native solvers "
"(``linear_model`` = 1 OLS, 2 elastic-net, 3 adaptive LASSO) with cross-"
"validation, for comparison with the external regressors."
msgstr ""
"``optimizer_control`` プロパティは、外部回帰器との比較のために、交差検証を備えた ALM のネイティブソルバー "
"(``linear_model`` = 1 OLS、2 elastic-net、3 adaptive LASSO) を公開します。"

